      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Irena%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village was re‑established in 1999 as a private, low‑density community, reviving its historic roots.",
