      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Irena%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Irena sits just east of US Route 169 on County Road 223, placing it in north‑central Worth County.",
